There is a formula for double exponential (laplace) at
http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laplace_distribution
for generating sample from uniform(-.5, .5) first and then doing a transformation.

For inv_chi_square, we can generate chi_square and take the reciprocal.  Or inv_chi_squaure is a special case of inverse gamma.

--
Jiqiang

