A general comment, probably unrelated to this particular bug, is that I don't know if K = 5 is so good. This link

http://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/prc/section2/prc211.htm

suggests setting K = round(2 * N^(2/5)), which would be 80 in this case.

Ben

