From u1004dd6f66bb10c3 at groups.google.com  Thu Mar  7 18:03:13 2013
From: u1004dd6f66bb10c3 at groups.google.com (Matt Hoffman)
Date: Thu, 07 Mar 2013 18:03:13 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-dev] local adaptation
Message-ID: <vy_QcoGKltk.YlQq08ETaIQJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
